<subpara id="X39400000RB01PC_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D7A00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze frame data. The freeze frame data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>First perform troubleshooting for DTCs P0340/12, P0342/12, P0343/12, P0345/18, P0347/18, P0348/18; if no malfunctioning area is found, a mechanical system malfunction is suspected.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
